call: answer 481 to a Replaces without a matching call

An INVITE whose Replaces header matches no call reached
call_stream_stop() and call_event_handler() with a NULL call, and
baresip crashed. procd stops respawning it after 5 crashes an hour, so
anyone who can reach the SIP port could silence the phone.

--- a/src/call.c
+++ b/src/call.c
@@ -2222,6 +2222,19 @@
 			return err;
 
 		rcall = call_find_id(ua_calls(call->ua), rid);
+		if (!rcall) {
+			mem_deref(rid);
+
+			/* RFC 3891 3: no match is 481, not a crash */
+			sip_treply(NULL, uag_sip(), msg,
+				   481, "Call/Transaction Does Not Exist");
+
+			call_event_handler(call, CALL_EVENT_CLOSED,
+					   "Replaces: no such call");
+
+			return 0;
+		}
+
 		call_stream_stop(rcall);
 		call_event_handler(rcall, CALL_EVENT_CLOSED,
 			"%s replaced", rid);
